---
title: GHOST — startup
---
%% Intended design; not runtime evidence
flowchart TD
  Start["Start"] --> Mutex{"Per-user instance acquired?"}
  Mutex -->|No| Signal["Signal normal Workspace then exit"]
  Mutex -->|Yes| Config["Load and validate settings"]
  Config --> Manifest{"Manifest valid and supported?"}
  Manifest -->|Yes| Hydrate["Load metadata and clamp layout"]
  Manifest -->|No| Recovery["Preserve originals; backup or read-only recovery"]
  Recovery --> Hydrate
  Hydrate --> Children["Children stopped; camera off"]
  Children --> Hotkeys{"Register configured hotkeys?"}
  Hotkeys -->|Conflict| Remap["Show conflict; tray fallback"]
  Hotkeys -->|Success| Tray["Tray ready"]
  Remap --> Tray
  Tray --> First{"First launch?"}
  First -->|Yes| Onboard["Compact onboarding"]
  First -->|No| Dormant["Dormant reference layer"]
  Onboard --> Dormant
